WEBVTT

00:03:28.535 --> 00:03:34.345
There is nobody else
who can answer this question for us.

00:03:34.345 --> 00:03:41.075
How is India seen by the world

00:03:41.075 --> 00:03:45.515
in terms of people, resources,
technology, future, everything,

00:03:45.515 --> 00:03:47.875
because you are 
the right person to ask this.

00:03:49.778 --> 00:03:54.048
The great thing about India is,
India is over a billion people,

00:03:54.437 --> 00:03:57.537
people are the most important 
resource of any country

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:02.244
and people have always had
this promise of India.